{"version":1,"content":"<p>蔡卓妍（阿Sa）今天（27日）穿上露腰長裙，為下月舉行的馬場活動宣傳，強調並不是證未有身孕而刻意展示纖腰，笑言：「好正常之嘛！</p><p>條腰一係露，一係唔露㗎啦！</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T09:42:31.961013+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":79,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T08:06:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:38:22.360051+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T09:38:15.487442+00:00","content_hash":"28ad8b519c7fa7197860fc9b7c34dc53b6d45f5e80e273ed96c522f21cab5ad4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}